			"notes": {
				"rationale": "sich beteiligen 'take part' (Duden beteiligen 1: sich an einem Spiel beteiligen) needs the reflexive, since jemanden an etwas beteiligen gives someone a share (2), another sense. So sich is a member, and it fills the 🪞 Reading's Required Reflexive Slot with Acc (ich beteilige mich), named in valencyEvidence and left out of the normalized Surface (ADR 0052). an + Dat is governed, a member left out of the normalized Surface too, and wird is the future auxiliary (de/verb-owns-its-scattered-members, de/governed-preposition-joins-its-governor, de/auxiliary-joins-the-verb-it-serves). Knowledge (#887, dev draft): No E-VALBU entry; DWDS brackets the an-object, so its Slot is Optional."
			},
